





                       ╭─ Command Palette ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
                       │❯ command… e.g. maly next                                                                  │
                       │───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
                       │  playlist list         list playlists                                                     │
                       │  playlist show <name>  show playlist tracks                                               │
                       │  playlist create <name…create a playlist                                                  │
                       │  playlist delete <name…delete a playlist (confirmation required)                          │
                       │  playlist add <name> <…add songs to a playlist                                            │
                       │  playlist remove <name…remove a song from a playlist                                      │
                       │  playlist play <name>  play a playlist                                                    │
                       │  playlist export <name…export playlist to M3U                                             │
                       │  playlist import <file…import playlist from M3U                                           │
                       │  get pick <search>     search and choose a download                                       │
                       │  get playlist <url> [<…download a playlist                                                │
                       │❯ playlist delete 'Mi lista'                                                               │
                       │delete playlist "Mi lista"? this can't be undone — type y to confirm, anything else cancel…│
                       │kept "Mi lista"                                                                            │
                       │❯ playlist delete 'Mi lista'                                                               │
                       │delete playlist "Mi lista"? this can't be undone — type y to confirm, anything else cancel…│
                       │❯                                                                                          │
                       │kept "Mi lista"                                                                            │
                       │❯ playlist delete 'Mi lista'                                                               │
                       │delete playlist "Mi lista"? this can't be undone — type y to confirm, anything else cancel…│
                       │❯ no                                                                                       │
                       │kept "Mi lista"                                                                            │
                       │❯ playlist delete 'Mi lista'                                                               │
                       │delete playlist "Mi lista"? this can't be undone — type y to confirm, anything else cancel…│
                       │esc cancels · y + enter: yes · empty enter: no                                             │
                       ╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯







